</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></header><style>.bde-section-2841-100{background-image:url(https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Ketelhuis-EHV-Casserole-Locatie.png)}.bde-section-2841-100>.bde-section-background-overlay{background-color:#000;transition:background-color var(--bde-transition-duration) ease-in-out}.bde-section-2841-100>.bde-section-background-overlay{opacity:0.4}.bde-section-2841-100{--eh-element-slug:bde-section-2841-100;--eh-element-id:100}@media (max-width:1119px){.bde-section-2841-100{--eh-element-slug:bde-section-2841-100;--eh-element-id:100}}@media (max-width:1023px){.bde-section-2841-100{--eh-element-slug:bde-section-2841-100;--eh-element-id:100}}@media (max-width:767px){.bde-section-2841-100{--eh-element-slug:bde-section-2841-100;--eh-element-id:100}}@media (max-width:479px){.bde-section-2841-100{--eh-element-slug:bde-section-2841-100;--eh-element-id:100}}</style><section class="bde-section-2841-100 bde-section"><div class="section-background-overlay bde-section-background-overlay"></div><div class="section-container"><h1 class="bde-heading-2841-101 bde-heading">
Industrial chic on a historic estate</h1><div class="bde-text-2841-102 bde-text">
Landgoed de Grote Beek, Eindhoven</div></div></section><section class="bde-section-2841-103 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><div class="bde-text-2841-104 bde-text fade-text"></div><div class="bde-code-block-2841-105 bde-code-block"> <script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script type="litespeed/javascript">const text=`Do you love a modern, industrial look? Then Het Ketelhuis is the perfect location for you. This former factory combines industrial charm with the tranquility of an estate. Perfect for modern weddings, corporate events, and galas.`;const container=document.querySelector(".fade-text");text.split("").forEach(char=>{const span=document.createElement("span");span.textContent=char;container.appendChild(span)});const spans=document.querySelectorAll(".fade-text span");const speedFactor=0.0005;const chunkSize=1;window.addEventListener("scroll",()=>{const rect=container.getBoundingClientRect();const windowHeight=window.innerHeight;let progress=(windowHeight-(rect.top-200))/(windowHeight+rect.height*speedFactor);progress=Math.min(Math.max(progress,0),1);const visibleCount=Math.floor(progress*spans.length/chunkSize)*chunkSize;spans.forEach((span,index)=>{if(index<visibleCount){span.classList.add("visible")}else{span.classList.remove("visible")}})})</script> </div></div></section><section class="bde-section-2841-106 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><div class="bde-div-2841-107 bde-div"><h2 class="bde-heading-2841-108 bde-heading">
From factory to event venue</h2><div class="bde-text-2841-109 bde-text">
Het Ketelhuis was once part of a utility facility on the De Grote Beek Estate. The characteristic industrial elements – high ceilings, steel beams, brick walls – have been preserved. Through careful renovation, it has been transformed into a versatile event venue with all modern conveniences.<br><br>Its location on the green estate makes Het Ketelhuis unique: you combine the rugged look of an industrial building with the peace and space of the surrounding nature.</div></div></div></section><section class="bde-section-2841-110 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><div class="bde-div-2841-111 bde-div"></div><div class="bde-div-2841-112 bde-div"></div><div class="bde-div-2841-113 bde-div"></div><div class="bde-div-2841-114 bde-div"></div><div class="bde-div-2841-115 bde-div"></div></div></section><section class="bde-section-2841-116 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><div class="bde-div-2841-117 bde-div"><h2 class="bde-heading-2841-118 bde-heading">
Spaces</h2><div class="bde-text-2841-119 bde-text">
Flexible and versatile</div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-120 bde-div"><div class="bde-grid-2841-121 bde-grid"><div class="bde-div-2841-122 bde-div"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNTYwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjE3MDYiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNTYwIDE3MDYiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+" class="bde-image2-2841-123 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal.webp" alt="Moderne evenementenruimte met hoge plafonds, industriële mezzanine, verlichte bar en witte tafels met zwarte barkrukken" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal.webp 2560w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal-300x200.webp 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal-1024x682.webp 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal-768x512.webp 768w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal-1536x1024.webp 1536w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/grote-zaal-2048x1365.webp 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" width="2560" height="1706" /><div class="bde-div-2841-124 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-125 bde-text">
Theater hall</div><div class="bde-text-2841-126 bde-text">
Capacity: 300 people, expandable to 500 people</div><div class="bde-text-2841-127 bde-text">
Perfect for:</div><ul class="bde-basic-list-2841-128 bde-basic-list"><li  >
Ceremonies and wedding parties</li><li  >
Gala dinners</li><li  >
Product presentations</li><li  >
Networking events</li><li  >
Dance parties</li></ul></div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-129 bde-div"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNTYwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjE3MDYiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNTYwIDE3MDYiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+" class="bde-image2-2841-130 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer.webp" alt="Elegant restaurant met donkerblauwe muren, witte tafels, kroonluchters en gouden accenten in het Ketelhuis" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer.webp 2560w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer-300x200.webp 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer-1024x682.webp 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer-768x512.webp 768w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer-1536x1024.webp 1536w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/ketelhuis-blauw-kamer-2048x1365.webp 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" width="2560" height="1706" /><div class="bde-div-2841-131 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-132 bde-text">
Blue Room</div><div class="bde-text-2841-133 bde-text">
Capacity: up to 65 people</div><div class="bde-text-2841-134 bde-text">
A separate room that is perfect for:</div><ul class="bde-basic-list-2841-135 bde-basic-list"><li  >
Intimate dinners</li><li  >
Breakout sessions at conferences</li><li  >
VIP area</li><li  >
Bridal suite (bride's dressing room)</li></ul></div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-136 bde-div"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNTYwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI1NjAiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNTYwIDI1NjAiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+" class="bde-image2-2841-137 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras.webp" alt="Modern ingericht terras met loungebanken, parasol en fireplace tussen bakstenen gebouwen" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras.webp 2560w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras-300x300.webp 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras-150x150.webp 150w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras-768x768.webp 768w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras-1536x1536.webp 1536w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/terras-2048x2048.webp 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" width="2560" height="2560" /><div class="bde-div-2841-138 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-139 bde-text">
Terrace</div><div class="bde-text-2841-140 bde-text">
Capacity: flexible</div><div class="bde-text-2841-141 bde-text">
The spacious terrace overlooks the estate and is ideal for:</div><ul class="bde-basic-list-2841-142 bde-basic-list"><li  >
Aperitif</li><li  >
BBQ and food trucks</li><li  >
Summer drinks</li><li  >
Outdoor ceremony</li><li  >
Smoke breaks and fresh air</li></ul></div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-143 bde-div"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNTYwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjE3MDMiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNTYwIDE3MDMiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+" class="bde-image2-2841-144 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal.webp" alt="Moderne loungeruimte met gestreepte fauteuils, industriële hanglampen en grote ramen met uitzicht op buitenterras" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal.webp 2560w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal-300x200.webp 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal-1024x681.webp 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal-768x511.webp 768w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal-1536x1022.webp 1536w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/proeflokaal-2048x1362.webp 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" width="2560" height="1703" /><div class="bde-div-2841-145 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-146 bde-text">
The Dining Room/Tasting Room</div><div class="bde-text-2841-147 bde-text">
Capacity: up to 50 people</div><div class="bde-text-2841-148 bde-text">
Our Dining Room is a cozy space where you can enjoy a delicious meal.<br><br>At La Casserole, we offer you various delicious menus. You can choose from different types of lunches, high teas, and sweet treats.</div></div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-149 bde-div"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNTYwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjE3MDgiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNTYwIDE3MDgiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+" class="bde-image2-2841-150 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe.webp" alt="Modern grand café interieur met sfeerverlichting, tafels met kaarsen en uitzicht op groen terras" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe.webp 2560w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe-300x200.webp 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe-768x512.webp 768w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe-1536x1025.webp 1536w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/grandcafe-2048x1366.webp 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" width="2560" height="1708" /><div class="bde-div-2841-151 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-152 bde-text">
The Grand Café</div><div class="bde-text-2841-153 bde-text">
Capacity: up to 100 people</div><div class="bde-text-2841-154 bde-text">
The Grand Café is part of this beautiful and unique location.<br><br>We can guarantee exclusivity in this room, due to the private entrance, restrooms, and kitchen.</div></div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-155 bde-div"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyNTYwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjIwNzAiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNTYwIDIwNzAiPjxyZWN0IHdpZHRoPSIxMDAlIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCUiIHN0eWxlPSJmaWxsOiNjZmQ0ZGI7ZmlsbC1vcGFjaXR5OiAwLjE7Ii8+PC9zdmc+" class="bde-image2-2841-156 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast.webp" alt="Ruime bed and breakfast kamer met tweepersoons bed, zithoek en houten balken onder een schuin dak" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast.webp 2560w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast-300x243.webp 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast-1024x828.webp 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast-768x621.webp 768w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast-1536x1242.webp 1536w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bed-and-breakfast-2048x1656.webp 2048w" data-sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" width="2560" height="2070" /><div class="bde-div-2841-157 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-158 bde-text">
Bed & Breakfast | Landgoed de Grote Beek</div><div class="bde-text-2841-159 bde-text">
The surrounding estate offers beautiful photo opportunities and walking possibilities.</div></div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-160 bde-div"><div class="bde-div-2841-161 bde-div"><h2 class="bde-heading-2841-162 bde-heading">
Come discover Het Ketelhuis</h2><div class="bde-text-2841-163 bde-text">
Curious about the atmosphere and possibilities of Het Ketelhuis? We would be happy to welcome you for a personal tour. Simply make an appointment and we will take the time to answer all your questions.</div><div class="bde-button-2841-164 bde-button">
<a class="breakdance-link button-atom button-atom--primary bde-button__button" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1871767e77587479357b796b6b7d6a77747d367674276b6d7a727d7b6c254b7b707d7c6d747d386e716b716c386c7738537d6c7d74706d716b3e7a777c6125" target="_blank" data-type="contact">
<span class="button-atom__text">Make an appointment</span>
</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bde-section-2841-165 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><div class="bde-div-2841-166 bde-div"><h2 class="bde-heading-2841-167 bde-heading">
What's included</h2><div class="bde-text-2841-168 bde-text">
Complete service</div><div class="bde-text-2841-169 bde-text">
At Het Ketelhuis, you get the full La Casserole service.</div></div><div class="bde-div-2841-170 bde-div"><div class="bde-grid-2841-171 bde-grid"><div class="bde-div-2841-172 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-173 bde-text">
Always included:</div><ul class="bde-basic-list-2841-174 bde-basic-list"><li  >
Exclusive use of The Boiler House</li><li  >
Tables and chairs (various arrangements)</li><li  >
Basic decoration</li><li  >
Complete catering facilities</li><li  >
Professional kitchen</li><li  >
Free parking facilities (500 spaces)</li><li  >
Day Coordinator</li></ul></div><div class="bde-div-2841-175 bde-div"><div class="bde-text-2841-176 bde-text">
Optional add-ons:</div><ul class="bde-basic-list-2841-177 bde-basic-list"><li  >
Extensive styling and decoration</li><li  >
Entertainment (DJ, live muziek)</li><li  >
Technical (sound and lighting system)</li><li  >
Projector and screens (for presentations)</li><li  >
Extra facilities (photobooth, special effects)</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bde-section-2841-178 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><h2 class="bde-heading-2841-179 bde-heading">
Book Het Ketelhuis</h2><div class="bde-text-2841-180 bde-text">
Curious if your date is available? Check the calendar or schedule a viewing.</div><div class="bde-div-2841-181 bde-div"><div class="bde-button-2841-182 bde-button">
<a class="breakdance-link button-atom button-atom--primary bde-button__button" href="https://la-casserole.nl/en/agenda-en/" target="_self" data-type="url"  >
<span class="button-atom__text">Check beschikbaarheid</span>
</a></div></div></div></section><footer class="bde-section-2637-101 bde-section"><div class="section-container"><div class="bde-columns-2637-129 bde-columns"><div class="bde-column-2637-130 bde-column"><a class="bde-container-link-2637-133 bde-container-link breakdance-link" href="https://la-casserole.nl/en/home-en/" target="_self" data-type="url"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMTk3IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjY3OCIgdmlld0JveD0iMCAwIDExOTcgNjc4Ij48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwJSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxMDAlIiBzdHlsZT0iZmlsbDojY2ZkNGRiO2ZpbGwtb3BhY2l0eTogMC4xOyIvPjwvc3ZnPg==" class="bde-image2-2637-134 bde-image2" data-src="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/logo.png" alt="La Casserole logo met casserole pictogram en tekst Pure Passie Sinds 1983" loading="lazy" data-srcset="https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/logo.png 1197w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/logo-300x170.png 300w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/logo-1024x580.png 1024w, https://la-casserole.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/logo-768x435.png 768w" data-sizes="(max-width: 1197px) 100vw, 1197px" width="1197" height="678" /></a><div class="bde-text-2637-135 bde-text">
